<h2>How can we help?</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:seleneith@163.com">seleneith@163.com</a> for product questions or order assistance. To request a return, <a href="https://returns.seleneith.com/">use our return request form</a>; we will review your request and reply by email within 48 hours. Seleneith is based in China and ships orders from China.</p><ul><li><strong>Existing orders:</strong> include your order number and billing email.</li><li><strong>Product questions:</strong> include the product name or page link, and the color, size or style you are considering.</li><li><strong>Damaged or incorrect items:</strong> describe the issue; photos of the item and packaging help us investigate.</li><li><strong>Returns:</strong> contact us for instructions and the correct return address before sending an item.</li></ul><p>Do not send passwords or full payment-card details by email.</p><div class="information-links"><a href="/pages/track-my-order/">Check your order</a><a href="/pages/shipping-policy/">Shipping Policy</a><a href="/pages/return-policy/">Return Policy</a></div>
