 'privacy-policy'=>['Privacy Policy', <<<'HTML'
<p>Last updated: 13 November 2026</p><h2>Who we are</h2><p>Seleneith is an online jewelry store based in China. For privacy questions and requests, contact <a href="mailto:seleneith@163.com">seleneith@163.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Information used by the store</h2><p>When you create an account, contact us, request a discount code or place an order, we use the details you provide, such as your name, email, delivery and billing addresses, selected products and messages. Order records can include payment status and transaction references. Website requests also involve technical information such as IP addresses, cookies and browser details.</p>
<h2>Why we use information</h2><p>We use information to provide account access, maintain shopping sessions and wishlists, process orders and payments, arrange delivery, answer questions, review return requests (including your contact email, order number, selected items, reason and details), send requested codes and order notifications, prevent misuse and meet applicable record-keeping requirements. Where applicable, processing is based on fulfilling your request or contract, legal obligations, legitimate interests in operating and protecting the store, or your consent for optional activities.</p>
<h2>Cookies and saved preferences</h2><p>Shopping-session and login cookies support the cart and account features. A market preference can be saved so the store remembers your country and currency. Guest wishlist items are stored in your browser; signed-in wishlists are saved to your account. You can clear browser storage or change cookie settings, although doing so may affect these features.</p>
<h2>Email offers</h2><p>When you request a discount code, we use your email to create an email-restricted coupon and send the code. If you separately choose optional marketing updates, that choice is separate from order-related messages. Contact us if you wish to change your communication preferences.</p>
<h2>Service providers and payments</h2><p>Hosting, email, payment and fulfilment services use information needed for their roles. PayPal processes payment information under its own privacy terms; the store receives information needed to record and manage the transaction. Delivery providers may receive contact and address details needed to deliver an order. Information may also be disclosed where required by law or to resolve a dispute.</p>
<h2>Storage, location and retention</h2><p>Seleneith operates from China, and service providers may process information in other countries. Retention depends on the purpose: account information supports the account, order and transaction records support fulfilment, after-sales service and applicable legal obligations, and support correspondence supports enquiries and disputes. Retention and deletion must also take account of fraud prevention, accounting and legal requirements. Contact us to ask about information held about you or to request deletion.</p>
<h2>Your choices and requests</h2><p>Depending on applicable law, you may have rights to access, correct or delete information, restrict or object to processing, obtain a copy, withdraw consent or complain to a relevant data-protection authority. Some records may need to be retained for legal obligations or unresolved transactions. Email us from the address associated with your account or order; we may need information to verify the request.</p>
HTML],
 'terms-and-conditions'=>['Terms and Conditions', <<<'HTML'
<p>Last updated: 13 November 2026</p><h2>Shopping with Seleneith</h2><p>Seleneith is an online jewelry store based in China. Contact <a href="mailto:seleneith@163.com">seleneith@163.com</a> for order questions or assistance.</p>
<h2>Products and selected options</h2><p>Review the product details and selected color, size, quantity or style before ordering. Options may have different prices and availability. Colors can appear differently on different screens. If a measurement, material or finish is unclear, contact us before ordering.</p>
<h2>Prices and payment</h2><p>The store supports USD, CAD and AUD. Check the currency and total shown at checkout. Discount codes are subject to their stated conditions and expiry. Payments are processed through PayPal, with available options displayed at checkout. Keep your order confirmation and contact us if you notice an error.</p>
<h2>Shipping and delivery</h2><p>We ship from China to the United States, Canada and Australia. Delivery estimates, shipping charges, import-charge information and address-change arrangements are set out in our <a href="/pages/shipping-policy/">Shipping Policy</a>. Review all amounts shown at checkout; shipping charges do not by themselves include uncollected import duties, destination taxes or carrier handling fees.</p>
<h2>Returns, refunds and product problems</h2><p>Use the <a href="https://returns.seleneith.com/">return request form</a> to send us your contact email, order number, products and reason. We will review the request manually and reply by email within 48 hours. Our <a href="/pages/return-policy/">Return Policy</a> explains voluntary returns, conditions, return costs, refunds and the manufacturing-defect warranty. Contact us before returning an item so we can provide instructions and the correct address. Mandatory consumer rights remain applicable.</p>
<h2>Order details and your account</h2><p>Provide an accurate email and delivery address. Contact us promptly if anything needs correcting; changes depend on the stage of fulfilment. Keep your account password private. Use <a href="/pages/track-my-order/">Track My Order</a> or your account to view order details.</p>
<h2>Contact and privacy</h2><p>For assistance or complaints, email <a href="mailto:seleneith@163.com">seleneith@163.com</a> with your order number and a description of the issue. Our <a href="/pages/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains the use of personal information.</p>
HTML],
